  next pane | tab | tab | on
  previous pane | shift+tab | shift+tab | on
  zoom | z | z | on
  refresh | r | r | on
  focus pane | 1 2 | 1/2 | on

Pinned
  left | left h | ←/h | on
  right | right l | →/l | on
  up | up k | ↑/k | on
  down | down j | ↓/j | on
  open | enter | ↵ | on
